1. Installation of durable epoxy flooring;
2. Upgrading walls;
3. Ensuring restrooms meet ADA compliance standards;
4. Coordination of work in a high-traffic community space;
5. Compliance with all relevant codes and regulations.
Period of Performance: The contract will commence upon award by the City Council and is expected to be completed within 60 calendar days from the issuance of the Notice to Proceed.
Place of Performance: The work will be performed at the Police Athletic League (PAL) Gym located at 600 SW 14th Avenue, Homestead, FL 33030.
Bidder Requirements: Bidders must be qualified Florida contractors with valid licenses and must submit evidence of their qualifications including: a permanent place of business; technical knowledge and experience; resumes of key personnel; financial stability; and references from similar projects.

Bidders must also provide a Bid Bond of 10% of the total bid amount and comply with all insurance requirements as specified in the solicitation.

