Background: The University of Central Florida Board of Trustees is seeking construction management services for the Discovery and Innovation Hub project located at Daytona State College, 150 Hilton Ave, Daytona Beach, FL 32114. The project aims to support UCF's mission by enhancing educational facilities and increasing parking availability. The total project cost is estimated at approximately $60 million, with a construction cost of around $46 million, subject to funding availability.
