Background: The Union County Board of County Commissioners is issuing a solicitation for the Courthouse Window Replacement project, which aims to enhance the original Union County courthouse building. The project includes significant renovations to improve the building's structural integrity and aesthetic appeal.
Work Details: The scope of work includes:
