Place of Performance: The work will be performed at Spec Martin Stadium, located in DeLand, Florida.
Bidder Requirements: Bidders must demonstrate qualifications including financial data, previous experience, and present commitments. They must be authorized to do business in Florida and provide their contractor license number. Additionally, bidders are required to submit a list of proposed subcontractors or suppliers within ten days after bid opening.

Background: The City of Pompano Beach, Florida, is seeking bids for the South Riverside Dr. and Atlantic Blvd. Stormwater Improvements project. This project aims to enhance flood protection and water quality in the area and is funded through the State Revolving Fund Program. It is essential for mitigating existing drainage deficiencies in a residential area.
