3) Construction of a 2” force main using PVC C900 or HDPE with an SDR of 11 or equivalent material;
4) Compliance with local building permits and environmental regulations.

Contractors are responsible for selecting tank manufacturers and models for installation, which must be approved through the shop drawing process.
